</figure>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"7458ffe","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"3e9aa22","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"edf74b4","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Factors influencing the cost to hire RPA Developer in India Mumbai","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_line_height":{"unit":"em","size":1.3,"sizes":[]},"typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"1daaa39","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"b336ea8","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p><strong><em>RPA Developer cost in India</em></strong> is influenced by a variety of factors. Let us look at some of the most important salary influencing factors:</p>
<p>Location</p>
<p>Experience and Job role</p>
<p><a href="https://reapmind.com/contact-us/"><img class="aligncenter wp-image-103157 size-full" src="https://reapmind.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/2nd-blog-image-17.png" alt="Factors influencing the cost to hire RPA Developer in India Mumbai" width="1832" height="680" /></a></p>
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><span id="RPA_Developer_Cost_in_India_Based_on_Location" class="ez-toc-section"></span><strong><em>RPA Developer Cost in India: Based on Location</em></strong></h4>
<p>Let us now examine the salaries of RPA developers in major Indian cities. In New Delhi, the cost to hire an RPA developer is Rs.775,000 per annum. RPA developer cost in Mumbai is on the low side. In Mumbai, you can expect to hire an RPA developer at Rs.400,000 per year. RPA developer cost in Bangalore is not comparable to the national average. The amount, in this case, is Rs. 533,000 per annum. Hyderabad’s average cost is about Rs. 506,000 per year, whereas Pune’s average wage is greater than that of other cities at Rs. 701,000 per year. In Chennai, the typical base to hire an RPA developer is roughly 614,000 rupees per year, compared to about 574,000 rupees in Kolkata. (Glassdoor data taken.)</p>
<p>RPA Developer Pay in India: Experience-Based</p>
<p><strong><em>Let’s examine the variations in RPA developer costs in India according to experience.</em></strong></p>
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><span id="RPA_Developer_Starting_Pay_in_India" class="ez-toc-section"></span>RPA Developer Starting Pay in India</h4>
<p>When they first start to gain experience, what do RPA developers make?</p>
<p>An annual cost for an entry-level RPA developer in India ranges from Rs. 650,000 to Rs. 1,100,000.</p>
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><span id="Cost_to_Hire_a_Mid-Level_RPA_Developer_in_India" class="ez-toc-section"></span>Cost to Hire a Mid-Level RPA Developer in India</h4>
<p>In India, the average income for a mid-level RPA developer is Rs. 1,200,000 per year, with a maximum cost of Rs. 2,000,000 per annum</p>
<h4 class="wp-block-heading"><span id="Cost_of_a_Senior_Level_RPA_Developer_in_India" class="ez-toc-section"></span>Cost of a Senior Level RPA Developer in India</h4>
<p>In India, the average senior-level RPA Developer salary is 1,600,000 per year.</p>
<p><strong>The cost to hire an RPA Developer Cost in Mumbai:</strong> Job Roles Based</p>
<p>Based on job roles, the average cost of an RPA Developer in India Mumbai is:</p>
<p><strong>RPA Process Transformation Analyst:</strong> Rs. 1,500,000 per year, with a higher limit of Rs. 2,000,000 per year.</p>
<p><strong>RPA Architect:</strong> Rs. 1,400,000 per annum for the lower limit and Rs. 1,800,000 for the upper limit</p>
<p><strong>RPA Project Manager:</strong> Rs. 1,400,000 per year with a higher limit of Rs. 1,800,000 per year</p>
<p><strong>Disclaimer:</strong> The above mentioned info is taken from different sources, thus better to get connected with an expert RPA development company and talk about your project requirements and details.</p>"},"elements":[],"widgetType":"text-editor"}],"isInner":true}],"isInner":true},{"id":"7538d6a4","elType":"section","settings":[],"elements":[{"id":"1e53304b","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"_inline_size":null},"elements":[{"id":"4b77dc3d","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Conclusion","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_family":"Poppins","title_color":"#012D50","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":28,"sizes":[]},"typography_font_weight":"600","typography_letter_spacing":{"unit":"px","size":0.3,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"},{"id":"5c28dbcf","elType":"widget","settings":{"space":{"unit":"px","size":20,"sizes":[]}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"spacer"},{"id":"22112605","elType":"widget","settings":{"editor":"<p>We hope you enjoyed our blog on the cost to hire an RPA developer in India Mumbai. These figures are not set in stone. The true determinant of your cost is the skills the developer possesses, the mastery of them, and how quickly they grow and help the company grow.</p>
<p><strong><em>If you need a remote RPA developer in Mumbai, here are some reasons why working with ReapMind is a good choice:</em></strong></p>
